   "text": "blue    tracker process (camera, inference)\ngreen   core, once per camera sample (30 Hz)\nteal    hand shape → pose\npurple  core, once per display refresh\norange  one interaction at a time\nyellow  shared maths and trained models\ngrey    out: X11, overlay, control",
