   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "W, H            screen width and height, in pixels\nH/s             screen heights per second (cursor speed)\nframe heights   the picture's height = 1; x is scaled by aspect = 16/9\nL               palm length, ‖wrist → middle MCP‖, in metres\nimage[i]        landmark i in the mirrored picture, 0..1\nworld[i]        landmark i in metres, hand-centred\njoints          0 wrist · 4 thumb tip · 5, 9, 13, 17 MCPs · 8, 12, 16, 20 tips\nclamp(v, a, b)  min( max(v, a), b )\n← , →           is updated to , leads to\nnumbers         defaults from config.py; all can be set in config.toml",
   "originalText": "W, H            screen width and height, in pixels\nH/s             screen heights per second (cursor speed)\nframe heights   the picture's height = 1; x is scaled by aspect = 16/9\nL               palm length, ‖wrist → middle MCP‖, in metres\nimage[i]        landmark i in the mirrored picture, 0..1\nworld[i]        landmark i in metres, hand-centred\njoints          0 wrist · 4 thumb tip · 5, 9, 13, 17 MCPs · 8, 12, 16, 20 tips\nclamp(v, a, b)  min( max(v, a), b )\n← , →           is updated to , leads to\nnumbers         defaults from config.py; all can be set in config.toml",
   "fontSize": 16,
