   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "V4L2 · MJPG · 1280×720 @ 30 fps · buffer = 1\nt_capture = monotonic() at grab, before decode\nmirror: cv2.flip(frame, 1), then BGR → RGB\nv4l2-ctl: dynamic frame rate off,\n          anti-flicker at 60 Hz",
   "originalText": "V4L2 · MJPG · 1280×720 @ 30 fps · buffer = 1\nt_capture = monotonic() at grab, before decode\nmirror: cv2.flip(frame, 1), then BGR → RGB\nv4l2-ctl: dynamic frame rate off,\n          anti-flicker at 60 Hz",
