   "text": "HandLandmarker, LIVE_STREAM, ≤ 4 candidates\n  image: 21×3, fractions of the mirrored frame\n  world: 21×3, metres, origin at hand centre\nFaceLandmarker, 1 face: 478×3 mesh\nstamp_ms = max(int(1000·t_capture), last + 1)",
