   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "points: chin 152, forehead 10, cheeks 234 / 454\np = 1€( image_xy · (aspect, 1) )\nheight = ‖forehead − chin‖\nwidth  = ‖cheek − other cheek‖\ns_face = max( height / 0.177 m,\n              width  / 0.153 m )\n         [frame heights per metre]\nsize   = s_face · 0.177\nvisible while seen within the last 1.5 s",
   "originalText": "points: chin 152, forehead 10, cheeks 234 / 454\np = 1€( image_xy · (aspect, 1) )\nheight = ‖forehead − chin‖\nwidth  = ‖cheek − other cheek‖\ns_face = max( height / 0.177 m,\n              width  / 0.153 m )\n         [frame heights per metre]\nsize   = s_face · 0.177\nvisible while seen within the last 1.5 s",
