   "text": "Foreground gate: whose hand is it?  (hands.py)",
   "originalText": "Foreground gate: whose hand is it?  (hands.py)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 591.2,
   "y": 915.0,
   "width": 489.6,
   "height": 172.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-46"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 643744727,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 533492028,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RMS(P) = √( mean_i ‖p_i − mean(P)‖² )\ns_hand = RMS( image_xy · (aspect, 1) )\n         / RMS( world_xy )\n         [frame heights per metre: nearer = larger]\ns_min  = max( 0.8, 0.75 · s_face )\ntracked hand kept while   s_hand ≥ 0.85 · s_min\nnew hand admitted if      s_hand ≥ s_min\nboth places taken: the furthest gives way only if\n                          s_furthest < 0.7 · s_new",
   "originalText": "RMS(P) = √( mean_i ‖p_i − mean(P)‖² )\ns_hand = RMS( image_xy · (aspect, 1) )\n         / RMS( world_xy )\n         [frame heights per metre: nearer = larger]\ns_min  = max( 0.8, 0.75 · s_face )\ntracked hand kept while   s_hand ≥ 0.85 · s_min\nnew hand admitted if      s_hand ≥ s_min\nboth places taken: the furthest gives way only if\n                          s_furthest < 0.7 · s_new",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
