   "locked": false,
   "text": "Hand.update: one sample in  (hands.py)",
   "originalText": "Hand.update: one sample in  (hands.py)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "text-57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1887.2,
   "y": 915.0,
   "width": 470.4,
   "height": 172.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-54"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1879343460,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 737608423,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "world' = 1€( world ), each joint by its own speed\nfeatures = extract_features(image, world')\npose     = PoseTracker(features)\npalm (raw) → screen mapping → MotionTrack\narmed: tracked ≥ 150 ms, and not while it is\n       pinching, pressing or a fist\naimed: AIM held ≥ 200 ms (a press needs it)\nconsumed: this pose has been acted on or\n          rejected, and starts nothing more",
   "originalText": "world' = 1€( world ), each joint by its own speed\nfeatures = extract_features(image, world')\npose     = PoseTracker(features)\npalm (raw) → screen mapping → MotionTrack\narmed: tracked ≥ 150 ms, and not while it is\n       pinching, pressing or a fist\naimed: AIM held ≥ 200 ms (a press needs it)\nconsumed: this pose has been acted on or\n          rejected, and starts nothing more",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 168
  },
