   "locked": false,
   "text": "MotionTrack: 30 Hz samples → display-rate cursor  (filters.py)",
   "originalText": "MotionTrack: 30 Hz samples → display-rate cursor  (filters.py)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "text-65",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 852.0,
   "y": 1218.8,
   "width": 537.6,
   "height": 230.4,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-62"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1625947776,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 734559256,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "on each sample:\n  y     = 1€(u)\n  v_raw = (y − y_prev) / Δt\n  v ← v + α(Δt, 5 Hz) · (v_raw − v)\non each tick (Hand.step):\n  lead   = clamp( now − t_sample, 0, 50 ms )\n  target = y + v · lead                    (prediction)\n  k      = 1 − e^(−Δt / 12 ms)\n  shown ← shown + k · (target − shown)     (follow)\n  (ux, uy) = shown · H;   (x, y) = clamped to the screen\nspeed = ‖v‖   [screen heights per second]\nhistory: (t, ux, uy) of the last 0.6 s",
   "originalText": "on each sample:\n  y     = 1€(u)\n  v_raw = (y − y_prev) / Δt\n  v ← v + α(Δt, 5 Hz) · (v_raw − v)\non each tick (Hand.step):\n  lead   = clamp( now − t_sample, 0, 50 ms )\n  target = y + v · lead                    (prediction)\n  k      = 1 − e^(−Δt / 12 ms)\n  shown ← shown + k · (target − shown)     (follow)\n  (ux, uy) = shown · H;   (x, y) = clamped to the screen\nspeed = ‖v‖   [screen heights per second]\nhistory: (t, ux, uy) of the last 0.6 s",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 226
  },
