  {
   "id": "text-69",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1780.0,
   "y": 1218.8,
   "width": 489.6,
   "height": 192.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-66"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 84196940,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2065920251,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "box = (x 0.15, y 0.20, w 0.70, h 0.60) of the frame\no   = overshoot = 0.04\n\nn = (palm − box_xy) / box_wh\nn ← (n − 0.5) · (1 + 2·o) + 0.5\nu = ( n_x · W/H ,  n_y )      [screen heights]\n\nthe middle 70 % × 60 % of the picture covers the\nwhole screen, and 4 % more past every edge, so a\nhand never has to reach the edge of the picture",
   "originalText": "box = (x 0.15, y 0.20, w 0.70, h 0.60) of the frame\no   = overshoot = 0.04\n\nn = (palm − box_xy) / box_wh\nn ← (n − 0.5) · (1 + 2·o) + 0.5\nu = ( n_x · W/H ,  n_y )      [screen heights]\n\nthe middle 70 % × 60 % of the picture covers the\nwhole screen, and 4 % more past every edge, so a\nhand never has to reach the edge of the picture",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
