   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1694566832,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "w = world landmarks (m);   L = ‖w[9] − w[0]‖   (wrist → middle MCP)\nfor each finger f of index, middle, ring, pinky:\n  curl_f     = ‖tip − mcp‖ / L\n  straight_f = ‖tip − mcp‖ / ( ‖pip−mcp‖ + ‖dip−pip‖ + ‖tip−dip‖ )\nfacing = |n_z| / ‖n‖,    n = (w[5] − w[0]) × (w[17] − w[0])\n\npinch_index  = min( ‖thumb − index tip‖ / L , picture_pinch )\npinch_pinky  = ‖thumb − pinky tip‖ / L\npinch_others = min( ‖thumb − middle tip‖, ‖thumb − ring tip‖ ) / L\nthumb_tuck   = min over the middle finger's 3 bones of\n               dist(thumb, bone) / L\n  dist(p, ab):  t = clamp( (p−a)·(b−a) / ‖b−a‖², 0, 1 )\n                d = ‖ p − (a + t·(b−a)) ‖\n\nfinger_tilt = atan2( −d_z, −d_y )  in degrees,\n  d = (index tip − index MCP) + (middle tip − middle MCP)\n  0° upright · 90° pointing at the camera · more: pointing down\n\npicture_pinch, for hands seen side-on (p = image_xy · (aspect, 1)):\n  P     = max( ‖p[9] − p[0]‖ , 1.25 · ‖p[5] − p[17]‖ )\n  depth = |z_thumb − z_index| · aspect / P\n  picture_pinch = ∞                  if depth > 0.45\n                = ‖p[4] − p[8]‖ / P   otherwise",
   "originalText": "w = world landmarks (m);   L = ‖w[9] − w[0]‖   (wrist → middle MCP)\nfor each finger f of index, middle, ring, pinky:\n  curl_f     = ‖tip − mcp‖ / L\n  straight_f = ‖tip − mcp‖ / ( ‖pip−mcp‖ + ‖dip−pip‖ + ‖tip−dip‖ )\nfacing = |n_z| / ‖n‖,    n = (w[5] − w[0]) × (w[17] − w[0])\n\npinch_index  = min( ‖thumb − index tip‖ / L , picture_pinch )\npinch_pinky  = ‖thumb − pinky tip‖ / L\npinch_others = min( ‖thumb − middle tip‖, ‖thumb − ring tip‖ ) / L\nthumb_tuck   = min over the middle finger's 3 bones of\n               dist(thumb, bone) / L\n  dist(p, ab):  t = clamp( (p−a)·(b−a) / ‖b−a‖², 0, 1 )\n                d = ‖ p − (a + t·(b−a)) ‖\n\nfinger_tilt = atan2( −d_z, −d_y )  in degrees,\n  d = (index tip − index MCP) + (middle tip − middle MCP)\n  0° upright · 90° pointing at the camera · more: pointing down\n\npicture_pinch, for hands seen side-on (p = image_xy · (aspect, 1)):\n  P     = max( ‖p[9] − p[0]‖ , 1.25 · ‖p[5] − p[17]‖ )\n  depth = |z_thumb − z_index| · aspect / P\n  picture_pinch = ∞                  if depth > 0.45\n                = ‖p[4] − p[8]‖ / P   otherwise",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
