   "text": "Rule classifier: the first match wins  (poses.py: PoseTracker)",
   "originalText": "Rule classifier: the first match wins  (poses.py: PoseTracker)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "text-77",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 875.2,
   "y": 1776.2,
   "width": 633.6,
   "height": 441.6,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-74"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1493135432,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 752002366,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 FIST         every curl < 0.58  (to stay: < 0.68), and not Y\n2 stay PINCH   its own pinch ratio < 0.42\n  stay PRESS   pointing, and thumb_tuck < 0.42\n3 PINCH_PINKY  pinch_pinky < 0.25 and\n               1.3 · pinch_pinky ≤ min(pinch_index, pinch_others)\n  PINCH_INDEX  pinch_index < 0.25\n4 pointing     straight_index ≥ 0.88, other three ≤ 0.72\n  AIM          thumb_tuck > 0.42 and facing ≥ 0.73\n  AIM → PRESS  thumb_tuck < 0.25\n  PRESS → AIM  thumb_tuck ≥ 0.42\n5 Y_SIGN       straight_pinky ≥ 0.85, other three ≤ 0.75,\n               thumb_tuck > 0.42, facing ≥ 0.73\n6 ILY          index ≥ 0.88, pinky ≥ 0.85, middle and ring ≤ 0.75,\n               facing ≥ 0.73\n7 extended_f   straight_f > 0.94  (to stay: > 0.90)\n  OPEN         all four extended\n  TWO_FINGER   index and middle extended, ring and pinky not\n8 CLAW         every 0.58 ≤ straight ≤ 0.86, min curl ≥ 0.36,\n               thumb > 0.38 clear of every fingertip\n9 NEUTRAL      otherwise\n\nenter / exit thresholds differ (hysteresis); pointing, Y and\nILY get ± 0.07 of slack once they are held",
   "originalText": "1 FIST         every curl < 0.58  (to stay: < 0.68), and not Y\n2 stay PINCH   its own pinch ratio < 0.42\n  stay PRESS   pointing, and thumb_tuck < 0.42\n3 PINCH_PINKY  pinch_pinky < 0.25 and\n               1.3 · pinch_pinky ≤ min(pinch_index, pinch_others)\n  PINCH_INDEX  pinch_index < 0.25\n4 pointing     straight_index ≥ 0.88, other three ≤ 0.72\n  AIM          thumb_tuck > 0.42 and facing ≥ 0.73\n  AIM → PRESS  thumb_tuck < 0.25\n  PRESS → AIM  thumb_tuck ≥ 0.42\n5 Y_SIGN       straight_pinky ≥ 0.85, other three ≤ 0.75,\n               thumb_tuck > 0.42, facing ≥ 0.73\n6 ILY          index ≥ 0.88, pinky ≥ 0.85, middle and ring ≤ 0.75,\n               facing ≥ 0.73\n7 extended_f   straight_f > 0.94  (to stay: > 0.90)\n  OPEN         all four extended\n  TWO_FINGER   index and middle extended, ring and pinky not\n8 CLAW         every 0.58 ≤ straight ≤ 0.86, min curl ≥ 0.36,\n               thumb > 0.38 clear of every fingertip\n9 NEUTRAL      otherwise\n\nenter / exit thresholds differ (hysteresis); pointing, Y and\nILY get ± 0.07 of slack once they are held",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
