   "seed": 979693494,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 147667305,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a candidate pose replaces the current one only after\nit has persisted:\n  into a pinch or press 30 ms · out of one 60 ms\n  fist 90 ms · claw, Y, ILY 300 ms · the rest 80 ms\n\npinch strength, for the cursor ring (r = pinch ratio):\n  hi = 1.6 · 0.42,   lo = 0.5 · 0.25\n  strength = clamp( (hi − r) / (hi − lo), 0, 1 )\n\nwhen the pose changes, it is spent at once (consumed) if\n  a pinch or press begins unarmed, or at a speed\n    > 2.5 H/s   (> 0.6 H/s when facing < 0.73)\n  a PRESS comes from a hand that had not taken aim",
   "originalText": "a candidate pose replaces the current one only after\nit has persisted:\n  into a pinch or press 30 ms · out of one 60 ms\n  fist 90 ms · claw, Y, ILY 300 ms · the rest 80 ms\n\npinch strength, for the cursor ring (r = pinch ratio):\n  hi = 1.6 · 0.42,   lo = 0.5 · 0.25\n  strength = clamp( (hi − r) / (hi − lo), 0, 1 )\n\nwhen the pose changes, it is spent at once (consumed) if\n  a pinch or press begins unarmed, or at a speed\n    > 2.5 H/s   (> 0.6 H/s when facing < 0.73)\n  a PRESS comes from a hand that had not taken aim",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 245
  },
