   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "x: 105 distances between 15 joints, taken twice\n   (world / L and picture / P) = 210 numbers\nh = ReLU( ((x − μ)/σ)·W₁ + b₁ )      48 units\np = softmax( h·W₂ + b₂ )             6 poses\npose = argmax p  if max p ≥ 0.6, else NEUTRAL\nreplaces the rules when [pose] model is set;\nthe debounce timings above still apply",
   "originalText": "x: 105 distances between 15 joints, taken twice\n   (world / L and picture / P) = 210 numbers\nh = ReLU( ((x − μ)/σ)·W₁ + b₁ )      48 units\np = softmax( h·W₂ + b₂ )             6 poses\npose = argmax p  if max p ≥ 0.6, else NEUTRAL\nreplaces the rules when [pose] model is set;\nthe debounce timings above still apply",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
