  },
  {
   "id": "text-89",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 44.0,
   "y": 2602.2,
   "width": 614.4,
   "height": 153.6,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-86"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1506442652,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 664876774,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1 for f in source.drain(): engine.on_frame(f)\n2 latency ← latency + 0.1 · ( (now − t_capture)·1000 − latency )\n3 backend.poll()         X events → cached window model\n4 tracker.step(now)      forget lost hands, predict cursors\n5 active.update(now)     the interaction in progress, if any\n6 nothing active: chin touch? → try_begin → swipe?\n7 two claps?             (only while nothing is active)\n8 build OverlayState → backend.flush() → Bridge → QML",
   "originalText": "1 for f in source.drain(): engine.on_frame(f)\n2 latency ← latency + 0.1 · ( (now − t_capture)·1000 − latency )\n3 backend.poll()         X events → cached window model\n4 tracker.step(now)      forget lost hands, predict cursors\n5 active.update(now)     the interaction in progress, if any\n6 nothing active: chin touch? → try_begin → swipe?\n7 two claps?             (only while nothing is active)\n8 build OverlayState → backend.flush() → Bridge → QML",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 149
  },
