   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "v = fastest Δp/Δt over 50 ms spans, last 250 ms\nflick if  |v_y| / H ≥ 2.0  and  |v_y| ≥ 1.5·|v_x|\nup → maximize;  down → minimize\nthe window is first put back to its rect\nat t_peak − 0.12 s",
   "originalText": "v = fastest Δp/Δt over 50 ms spans, last 250 ms\nflick if  |v_y| / H ≥ 2.0  and  |v_y| ≥ 1.5·|v_x|\nup → maximize;  down → minimize\nthe window is first put back to its rect\nat t_peak − 0.12 s",
   "fontSize": 16,
