   "locked": false,
   "text": "progress = (now − t₀) / 700 ms\ncancelled if ‖hand − origin‖ > 0.06·H,\nor the fist opens\nprogress ≥ 1 → _NET_CLOSE_WINDOW",
   "originalText": "progress = (now − t₀) / 700 ms\ncancelled if ‖hand − origin‖ > 0.06·H,\nor the fist opens\nprogress ≥ 1 → _NET_CLOSE_WINDOW",
