   "text": "Scroll: the tilt of two fingers  (scroll.py)",
   "originalText": "Scroll: the tilt of two fingers  (scroll.py)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "text-133",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 44.0,
   "y": 3904.4,
   "width": 595.2,
   "height": 288.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-130"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1265133104,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 391578344,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "θ = 1€( ((finger_tilt + 90) mod 360) − 90 )\nstill: |mean θ(last 125 ms) − mean θ(125 ms before)| ≤ 3°\nrest θ₀ = θ once still, ≥ 0.35 s after the pose\nlean = θ − θ₀;   dead zone D = 8°\n\ndown_from = max( θ₀ + D, 60° )\nfull_at   = max( θ₀ + 40°, down_from + 20° )\ndown: rate = min( (θ − down_from) / (full_at − down_from), 1 )\nup:   rate = −min( (−lean − D) / (25° − D), 1 )\n      only once leaned back for 0.3 s\n\nrest follows a still hand short of scrolling:\n  θ₀ ← θ₀ + lean · (1 − e^(−Δt/τ)),   τ = 0.5 s or 0.8 s\nnotches = −rate · 20 · Δt        (top speed 20 notches/s)\n  → uinput REL_WHEEL_HI_RES, 120 units to the notch",
   "originalText": "θ = 1€( ((finger_tilt + 90) mod 360) − 90 )\nstill: |mean θ(last 125 ms) − mean θ(125 ms before)| ≤ 3°\nrest θ₀ = θ once still, ≥ 0.35 s after the pose\nlean = θ − θ₀;   dead zone D = 8°\n\ndown_from = max( θ₀ + D, 60° )\nfull_at   = max( θ₀ + 40°, down_from + 20° )\ndown: rate = min( (θ − down_from) / (full_at − down_from), 1 )\nup:   rate = −min( (−lean − D) / (25° − D), 1 )\n      only once leaned back for 0.3 s\n\nrest follows a still hand short of scrolling:\n  θ₀ ← θ₀ + lean · (1 − e^(−Δt/τ)),   τ = 0.5 s or 0.8 s\nnotches = −rate · 20 · Δt        (top speed 20 notches/s)\n  → uinput REL_WHEEL_HI_RES, 120 units to the notch",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 283
  },
