   "seed": 899680760,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1148025345,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "roll = atan2( a_y, a_x ) in degrees,\n  a = pinky MCP − index MCP, in the picture\nturn ← turn + ((roll − roll_prev + 180) mod 360) − 180\n  (followed all the way round)\nturn = 1€(turn);   rest = turn at 0.25 s\n\nlean  = turn − rest\nmoved = sign(lean) · max( |lean| − 8°, 0 ) / 120°\nlevel = clamp( level₀ + moved, lowest, 1 )\n  lowest = 0.05 for brightness, 0 for volume\n\nset at most every 50 ms, in steps ≥ 0.01\non letting go: back to the level of 0.25 s before",
   "originalText": "roll = atan2( a_y, a_x ) in degrees,\n  a = pinky MCP − index MCP, in the picture\nturn ← turn + ((roll − roll_prev + 180) mod 360) − 180\n  (followed all the way round)\nturn = 1€(turn);   rest = turn at 0.25 s\n\nlean  = turn − rest\nmoved = sign(lean) · max( |lean| − 8°, 0 ) / 120°\nlevel = clamp( level₀ + moved, lowest, 1 )\n  lowest = 0.05 for brightness, 0 for volume\n\nset at most every 50 ms, in steps ≥ 0.01\non letting go: back to the level of 0.25 s before",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
