  {
   "id": "text-141",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1621.6,
   "y": 3904.4,
   "width": 508.8,
   "height": 230.4,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-138"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2046762209,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 269490964,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "(dx, dy) = hand − centre;   d = √(dx² + dy²)\nd ≤ 51 · ui.scale → nothing aimed at (dead zone)\nφ = atan2( dx, −dy ) mod 360°    (0° = up, clockwise)\n\nn items at φ_i = i · 360° / n\nin a submenu: wedge = 360° / (n + 1),\n  φ_i = φ_back + (i + 1) · wedge\nhover = the item with the least angular gap to φ\n\nd ≥ 150 · ui.scale on a submenu → it opens there\npinch let go → the hovered item is run\nonly the direction counts past the dead zone",
   "originalText": "(dx, dy) = hand − centre;   d = √(dx² + dy²)\nd ≤ 51 · ui.scale → nothing aimed at (dead zone)\nφ = atan2( dx, −dy ) mod 360°    (0° = up, clockwise)\n\nn items at φ_i = i · 360° / n\nin a submenu: wedge = 360° / (n + 1),\n  φ_i = φ_back + (i + 1) · wedge\nhover = the item with the least angular gap to φ\n\nd ≥ 150 · ui.scale on a submenu → it opens there\npinch let go → the hovered item is run\nonly the direction counts past the dead zone",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 226
  },
