  {
   "id": "text-145",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 44.0,
   "y": 4323.4,
   "width": 595.2,
   "height": 268.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-142"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1326270331,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1406529762,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "x: 165 numbers per frame, in palm lengths\n  q = image · (aspect, 1, aspect) − wrist\n  q ← q / mean( ‖q[5]‖, ‖q[9]‖, ‖q[17]‖ )\n  20 joints × 3 = 60 coordinates\n  + 105 distances between 15 key joints  (15·14/2)\nh = ReLU( ((x − μ)/σ)·W₁ + b₁ )            64 units\np = softmax( h·W₂ + b₂ )                   24 letters (+ rest)\nP ← P + (1 − e^(−Δt / 80 ms)) · (p − P)    smoothed over time\n\nwanted = the letters that carry on toward some macro or app\nletter = argmax of P over wanted; taken if P ≥ 0.35 for 400 ms\nthe same letter again: only after 250 ms as something else\nopened when it can be nothing longer, else after 1.2 s;\ngiven up after 6 s with no letter",
   "originalText": "x: 165 numbers per frame, in palm lengths\n  q = image · (aspect, 1, aspect) − wrist\n  q ← q / mean( ‖q[5]‖, ‖q[9]‖, ‖q[17]‖ )\n  20 joints × 3 = 60 coordinates\n  + 105 distances between 15 key joints  (15·14/2)\nh = ReLU( ((x − μ)/σ)·W₁ + b₁ )            64 units\np = softmax( h·W₂ + b₂ )                   24 letters (+ rest)\nP ← P + (1 − e^(−Δt / 80 ms)) · (p − P)    smoothed over time\n\nwanted = the letters that carry on toward some macro or app\nletter = argmax of P over wanted; taken if P ≥ 0.35 for 400 ms\nthe same letter again: only after 250 ms as something else\nopened when it can be nothing longer, else after 1.2 s;\ngiven up after 6 s with no letter",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 264
  },
