  {
   "id": "text-149",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 908.0,
   "y": 4323.4,
   "width": 595.2,
   "height": 172.8,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "group-146"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1931732424,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1870414235,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "~1900 public hands (ASLNow!) + your own recordings\n12 varied copies of each hand:\n  turned ± 15°, x stretched 0.85 to 1.18, half mirrored,\n  depth × 0.7 to 1.3, jitter ~ N(0, (0.02 · palm)²)\nloss = Σ_n w_n · CE(p_n, y_n),  every letter weighing the same\n∂loss/∂logits = (p − y) · w;   + 1e-4 · W  (weight decay)\nHe initialisation; Adam: lr 0.01, β₁ 0.9, β₂ 0.999\n300 epochs, whole set at once → letters.npz\n98 % on held-out public hands (same people both sides)",
   "originalText": "~1900 public hands (ASLNow!) + your own recordings\n12 varied copies of each hand:\n  turned ± 15°, x stretched 0.85 to 1.18, half mirrored,\n  depth × 0.7 to 1.3, jitter ~ N(0, (0.02 · palm)²)\nloss = Σ_n w_n · CE(p_n, y_n),  every letter weighing the same\n∂loss/∂logits = (p − y) · w;   + 1e-4 · W  (weight decay)\nHe initialisation; Adam: lr 0.01, β₁ 0.9, β₂ 0.999\n300 epochs, whole set at once → letters.npz\n98 % on held-out public hands (same people both sides)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "baseline": 168
