   "text": "window model cached, kept current from X events\nEWMH: _NET_MOVERESIZE_WINDOW · _NET_WM_STATE\n      _NET_CLOSE_WINDOW · _NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW\n      _NET_CURRENT_DESKTOP · _NET_WM_DESKTOP\nXTEST: mouse button, pointer, keys\n/dev/uinput: smooth wheel (else XTEST steps)\npactl · /sys/class/backlight · playerctl · xdotool\nFakeBackend: windows in memory (tests, --dry-run)",
   "originalText": "window model cached, kept current from X events\nEWMH: _NET_MOVERESIZE_WINDOW · _NET_WM_STATE\n      _NET_CLOSE_WINDOW · _NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW\n      _NET_CURRENT_DESKTOP · _NET_WM_DESKTOP\nXTEST: mouse button, pointer, keys\n/dev/uinput: smooth wheel (else XTEST steps)\npactl · /sys/class/backlight · playerctl · xdotool\nFakeBackend: windows in memory (tests, --dry-run)",
   "fontSize": 16,
