   "text": "OverlayState, every tick → Bridge → Qt Quick\nfullscreen, see-through, click-through,\noverride-redirect, raised every 2 s\nhand rings (left sky, right coral) that tighten\nwith the pinch; window frames; pie menu;\nswitcher cards; close ring; dial; spell HUD;\ndiagnostics (--debug)",
   "originalText": "OverlayState, every tick → Bridge → Qt Quick\nfullscreen, see-through, click-through,\noverride-redirect, raised every 2 s\nhand rings (left sky, right coral) that tighten\nwith the pinch; window frames; pie menu;\nswitcher cards; close ring; dial; spell HUD;\ndiagnostics (--debug)",
