   "text": "tray icon: pause, diagnostics, quit\nsocket: $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/holotouch.sock\nholotouch ctl pause | resume | toggle |\n              debug | status | quit\npanel: a process of its own that starts,\nstops and watches the core over the socket",
   "originalText": "tray icon: pause, diagnostics, quit\nsocket: $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/holotouch.sock\nholotouch ctl pause | resume | toggle |\n              debug | status | quit\npanel: a process of its own that starts,\nstops and watches the core over the socket",
