   "updated": 1759536000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "run --record FILE   → JSONL of FrameSamples\nrun --replay FILE   → the same engine, no camera\ncollect [--letters] → prompted, labelled recording\nscore               → what each pose was read as\ntrain               → the optional pose model\ntrain-letters       → ~/.config/holotouch/letters.npz\nconfig.toml: every threshold in this chart",
   "originalText": "run --record FILE   → JSONL of FrameSamples\nrun --replay FILE   → the same engine, no camera\ncollect [--letters] → prompted, labelled recording\nscore               → what each pose was read as\ntrain               → the optional pose model\ntrain-letters       → ~/.config/holotouch/letters.npz\nconfig.toml: every threshold in this chart",
